 4. When your printer appears in the list, select your
 printer, then click Add.


 It may take a minute or two for your printer to appear.
 If you see a message prompting you to download new
 software, make sure to download and install it.


 5. If you do not see your printer listed on the left,
 click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fax button on the
 right.



 A dialogue appears listing printers on your local network.






 &amp;nbsp;





 If your issue is still not resolved or you&#039;re unable to follow these
 instructions, contact our troubleshooting experts, who will diagnose the
 specific problem you&#039;re facing. Our certified experts will help you resolve
 the issue over the phone CALL OUR EXPERTS +1-512-885-1530.










 &amp;nbsp;




